      "message": "Consolidate trusted Pages publishing and retain bounded CI diagnostics (#37)\n\n* Profile browser gate with bounded sanitized timing metadata\n\n* Measure same-job concurrency against expanded-suite control\n\n* Evaluate bounded timezone rendering and consolidated artifact publication\n\n* Prevent canceled fallback verification from starting deployment\n\n* Reject timezone rendering experiment and measure lower CI contention\n\n* Keep four workers and measure the pinned ARM browser image\n\n* Retain x64 verification after slower ARM experiment",
